    "text": "By ANNABELLE REITER ,\n11 hours ago JOHNS CREEK, Ga. — Johns Creek boys basketball will play for a region title for the first time in 10 years after a 74-66 win over Milton in the region semi-final Feb. 17 at Chattahoochee High School. The Gladiators aim to secure the program’s first region title. It is... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
